cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MQEngine: Data-Driven C++20 3D Game Engine with Microkernel Plugin Architecture"
message: "If you use MQEngine in your projects, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MaaBlock"
    website: "https://github.com/MaaBlock"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaaBlock/MQEngine"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform C++20 3D game and graphics engine featuring data-driven scene and GPU rendering
  pipelines, a declarative TOML and two-way visual/code data configuration workflow, and an
  on-demand microkernel plugin architecture with hot-reload.
keywords:
  - game-engine
  - graphics-engine
  - data-driven
  - data-configuration-workflow
  - microkernel
  - plugin-architecture
  - ecs
  - cpp20
  - vulkan
  - directx-12
  - render-graph
  - bindless
  - gpu-driven
  - typescript
  - blueprint
  - 数据驱动
  - 数据配置流程
  - 微内核插件制
